      "source": "JNDI Locations, one of which must exist. If no locations are specific the condition\nmatches solely based on the presence of an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.naming/javax/naming/InitialContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.naming\"><code>InitialContext</code></a>.",
